":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"<div class=\"fn\">\nZeitschrift f\u00fcr Ethnologie.</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Paul Ehrenreich|Scans from the Internet Archive/unverified|PD US expired|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by F\u00e6|Books without Wikidata item|IA books of at least 500 pages|Images from the Getty Research Institute|Zeitschrift f\u00fcr Ethnologie, vol. 32 (1900)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Various_authors\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Various authors\"><span title=\"term used in bibliography for books, texts, publications or articles that contain collaborations\">various authors</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Suspended publication 1945-49</dd>\n<dd>Organ der Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, 18 -\u00a0; Deutschen Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, Ethnologie und Urgeschichte -\u00a0; Deutschen Gesellschaft f\u00fcr V\u00f6lkerkunde und der Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, Ethnologie und Urgeschichte, 19 -</dd>\n<dd>vols. 1-20, 1869-1888, 1 v.; vols. 21-34, 1889-1902, 1 v</dd>\n<dd>Proceedings of the Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, Ethnologie und Urgeschichte were issued in the \"Zeitschrift\", v. 1-2, without separate t.-p. and pagination; v. 3-34 with separate t.-p. and pagination</dd>\n<dd>v. 25 cm</dd>\n<dd>Title varies slightly</dd>\n<dd>In 1903 the two organs of the Society, the \"Verhandlungen\" and the \"Zeitschrift\" were combined under the title formerly used by the \"Zeitschrift\" alone, \"Zeitschrift f\u00fcr Ethnologie.\"</dd>\n<dd>Organ der Berliner Gesellschaft f\u00fcr Anthropologie, 18 -\u00a0; Deutschen Gesellschaft f\u0